OL,3,GNEWSANo plans for Manchester congestion
OL,4,Acharge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport bosses in Greater Manchester
OL,7,Fhave confirmed there are no plans for a
OL,8,Fcongestion charge in the city centre.
OL,10,FTransport for Greater Manchester (TfGM)
OL,11,Fconfirmed plans to "invest heavily" in
OL,12,Fpublic transport instead of introducing
OL,13,Fa congestion charge, the Local
OL,14,FDemocracy Reporting Service reported.
OL,16,FThe transport agency said it will be
OL,17,Finvesting invest #2.5bn of government
OL,18,Fmoney into the region between 2027 and
OL,19,F2032, and bringing trains to the Bee
OL,20,FNetwork from December.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
